    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introducing Trolls vs Vikings: Reborn \u2013 The Game Where Strategy Meets Mischief!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/c05e91351e598faf677a773cbfb6c0d0.avif?t=1743677211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to don your tactical horns (and maybe a trollish grin) for the ultimate strategy showdown. Building on the beloved original that enthralled over 1.3 million players and got massive nods from players, Apple, Microsoft, Amazon and Google, this premium edition cranks the epic dial to 11 with tons of new features and upgrades:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Difficulty Level:</strong> Think you\u2019re tough? Face 34 unforgiving levels that will make even the most seasoned strategists question their life choices. Are you brave enough to cry a little? Or a lot? Then this is for you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.poster.avif?t=1743677211\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.webm?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.mp4?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Special Missions:</strong> Dive into 35 mind-bending missions with encounters that include Nordic gods and scenarios so complex, you\u2019ll wonder if you\u2019re battling gods or writing a doctoral thesis in Viking trickery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overhauled Upgrade System:</strong> No more pay-to-win nonsense here! Loki tricked us into making the first game free-to-play (of course he did\u2014he\u2019s Loki). But we\u2019ve learned from our mischief-laden past and revamped the shard system to deliver pure, sweat-and-tears gameplay progression. Fair and balanced, like a troll on a tightrope.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.poster.avif?t=1743677211\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.webm?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.mp4?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revamped Spell Mechanics:</strong> Now you can sling spells with a sense of strategic satisfaction and a smirk that says, \u201cTake that, Thor.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Visuals:</strong> Witness trolls in their high-definition glory as they charge headfirst into the fray, with all the detail and clarity of a blockbuster movie (minus the popcorn).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.poster.avif?t=1743677211\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.webm?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.mp4?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remastered Soundtrack:</strong> Groove to the epic new \u201cTrolls Forever\u201d theme by Aleksandar Dimitrijevi\u0107, featuring real troll and gnome musicians. (Yes, we\u2019ve gone full method.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revitalized Viking Art and Animations:</strong> Our award-winning animator has infused the Vikings with so much personality, you\u2019ll almost feel bad stomping them. Almost.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.poster.avif?t=1743677211\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.webm?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.mp4?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Bragging rights? Absolutely. Earn achievements that show your strategic genius\u2014or your sheer stubbornness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Gameplay Experience:</strong> No more free-to-play elements here. We\u2019ve booted Loki\u2019s trickster schemes, so you can enjoy uninterrupted, pure strategy bliss. Or, wait, he is still in the game! Wonder what he is up to this time around?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.poster.avif?t=1743677211\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.webm?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.mp4?t=1743677211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, the legendary <strong>endless Valhalla levels</strong> are back, ready to put even the toughest tacticians to the test. Brace yourself for challenges so maddening that they\u2019ll leave you gripping your mouse, eyes wide, shouting, \u201cWho needs sleep, anyway?!\u201d and muttering, \u201cJust\u2026 one\u2026 more\u2026 round\u2026\u201d as dawn breaks through your window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive into Trolls vs Vikings: Reborn where strategy is king, trolls reign supreme, and your sanity is the final boss?</p>",
